	abstract = {UltraNest is a general-purpose Bayesian inference package for parameter estimation and model comparison. It allows ﬁtting arbitrary models speciﬁed as likelihood functions written in Python, C, C++, Fortran, Julia or R. With a focus on correctness and speed (in that order), UltraNest is especially useful for multi-modal or non-Gaussian parameter spaces, computational expensive models, in robust pipelines. Parallelisation to computing clusters and resuming incomplete runs is available.},
